她走进迈克尔的办公室，真心实意地安慰他。

316
00:14:28.380 --> 00:14:29.220
Michael is crying.
迈克尔在哭。

317
00:14:29.520 --> 00:14:30.480
He's really sweet.
他真的很可爱。

318
00:14:30.620 --> 00:14:32.400
He says, I'm worried about my friend.
他说，我为我的朋友感到担心。

319
00:14:32.940 --> 00:14:33.120
Yeah.
是啊。

320
00:14:33.260 --> 00:14:34.540
And she says, that's normal.
她说，这很正常。

321
00:14:34.760 --> 00:14:37.200
You take the time you need to have your feelings.
你需要花时间去消化你的情绪。

322
00:14:37.200 --> 00:14:44.280
Which leads to just a wonderful talking head, Angela, that I love, where Michael says, Holly
这引出了一个非常精彩的采访片段，安吉拉，我超爱那个片段，迈克尔说，霍莉

323
00:14:44.280 --> 00:14:46.600
is sweet and simple like a lady baker.
甜美又单纯，就像一位女烘焙师。

324
00:14:46.880 --> 00:14:51.440
And he just wouldn't be surprised to find out that she'd worked in a bakery before coming
而且他一点也不会惊讶，如果发现她在来邓德·米夫林之前

325
00:14:51.440 --> 00:14:52.380
to Dunder Mifflin.
真的在面包店工作过的话。

326
00:14:52.580 --> 00:14:55.720
I mean, he's pretty sure she's baked on a professional level.
我是说，他很确定她有过专业级别的烘焙经验。

327
00:14:56.060 --> 00:14:58.100
Because baking is love, right?
因为烘焙就是爱，对吧？

328
00:14:58.440 --> 00:14:58.780
Yeah.
是啊。

329
00:14:59.060 --> 00:15:00.520
Only sweet ladies bake.
只有甜美的女士才会烘焙。

330
00:15:00.700 --> 00:15:02.440
Sweet ladies who take care of you.
那些照顾你的甜美女士。

331
00:15:02.440 --> 00:15:03.120
Yeah.
是啊。

332
00:15:03.720 --> 00:15:04.120
Aww.
噢。

333
00:15:04.800 --> 00:15:09.380
Well, after this very sweet Michael talking head, we are all going to go out in the parking
好吧，在迈克尔这段非常温馨的采访之后，我们都要去停车场了，

334
00:15:09.380 --> 00:15:11.480
lot because the party is starting.
因为派对要开始了。

335
00:15:11.840 --> 00:15:12.400
Oh, yeah.
噢，没错。

336
00:15:12.720 --> 00:15:17.220
But before we get into that parking lot, Jenna, I need to share a little backstory.
但在我们进入停车场之前，珍娜，我得分享一点背景故事。

337
00:15:17.920 --> 00:15:18.480
Okay.
好的。

338
00:15:19.040 --> 00:15:25.160
Have you ever been on the phone with someone and you actually hear that person go into a
你有没有过在和某人通电话时，真的听到对方

339
00:15:25.160 --> 00:15:26.700
full flop sweat?
紧张到大汗淋漓？

340
00:15:27.220 --> 00:15:28.520
Where is this going?
这话题要往哪儿去？

341
00:15:29.300 --> 00:15:30.420
Because I have.
因为我有过。

342
00:15:30.760 --> 00:15:31.240
Okay.
好吧。

343
00:15:31.240 --> 00:15:32.260
I have.
我确实有过。

344
00:15:32.420 --> 00:15:34.160
And that person was Kent Zabornak.
那个人就是肯特·扎博纳克。

345
00:15:34.340 --> 00:15:35.120
Oh, my gosh.
天哪。

346
00:15:35.360 --> 00:15:36.160
Oh, gosh.
噢，天哪。

347
00:15:36.320 --> 00:15:40.240
Not only did I remember this, but then I found some emails between Kent and I that really
我不仅记得这件事，我还找到了我和肯特之间的一些邮件，它们真的

348
00:15:40.240 --> 00:15:41.060
painted the picture.
还原了当时的场景。

349
00:15:41.440 --> 00:15:45.240
And I wanted to share the story with you guys that I almost didn't make it to the parking
我想和你们分享这个故事，关于我差点就没能赶到

350
00:15:45.240 --> 00:15:45.560
lot.
停车场。

351
00:15:45.960 --> 00:15:47.520
Oh, now I know what you're talking about.
哦，现在我知道你在说什么了。

352
00:15:48.040 --> 00:15:55.040
In my emails, I found that on Thursday, April 10th of 2008 at 4 p.m., I had a routine
我在邮件里查到，2008年4月10日星期四下午4点，我有一个常规的

353
00:15:55.040 --> 00:15:56.840
checkup with my OBGYN.
妇产科检查。

354
00:15:57.120 --> 00:15:58.360
I emailed Kent about it.
我为此给肯特发了邮件。

355
00:15:58.360 --> 00:15:59.880
He said, no problem, Ange.
他说，没问题，安吉。

356
00:15:59.960 --> 00:16:02.920
We'll have you wrapped in time to make it to that doctor's appointment.
我们会让你按时收工，赶上那个医生的预约。

357
00:16:03.380 --> 00:16:08.380
So, lady, while I was at my doctor's appointment, you know, how they sort of check all your vitals
所以，女士们，当我在看医生的时候，你知道，他们会检查你所有的生命体征

358
00:16:08.380 --> 00:16:09.100
and do everything.
做各种检查。

359
00:16:09.320 --> 00:16:15.300
And I had had, like, I was feeling like a little bit of cramping, but nothing I was really
当时我感觉有点痉挛，但并没有什么

360
00:16:15.300 --> 00:16:15.860
worried about.
让我真正担心的。

361
00:16:15.860 --> 00:16:19.400
And she was like, Angela, you're having contractions.
然后她说，安吉拉，你在宫缩。

362
00:16:19.560 --> 00:16:20.640
And I said, what?
我说，什么？

363
00:16:20.920 --> 00:16:21.980
And she said, yeah.
她说，是的。

364
00:16:22.220 --> 00:16:24.900
And she immediately sent me to the hospital.
她立刻把我送到了医院。

365
00:16:25.200 --> 00:16:26.480
From your doctor's appointment?
从医生那里直接去的？

366
00:16:26.700 --> 00:16:28.740
From my doctor's appointment at 4 o'clock.
从我下午4点的医生预约那里直接去的。

367
00:16:28.880 --> 00:16:29.900
Now I'm in the hospital.
现在我在医院里。

368
00:16:30.100 --> 00:16:32.720
I'm having contractions every five minutes.
我每五分钟宫缩一次。

369
00:16:32.720 --> 00:16:39.300
And around 6 o'clock in the evening, Jenny O'Keefe, who was our second AD, called me to
大约晚上6点，我们的第二副导演珍妮·奥基夫给我打电话

370
00:16:39.300 --> 00:16:41.240
tell me my call time, right?
告诉我我的通告时间，对吧？

371
00:16:41.500 --> 00:16:42.520
For the next day.
就是第二天的工作时间。

372
00:16:42.620 --> 00:16:43.220
For the next day.
第二天的工作时间。

373
00:16:43.320 --> 00:16:46.040
She's like, hi, Angela, your call time tomorrow is 530 a.m.
她说，嗨，安吉拉，你明天的通告时间是早上5点半。

374
00:16:46.120 --> 00:16:47.680
And I said, Jenny, I'm in the hospital.
我说，珍妮，我在医院呢。

375
00:16:48.340 --> 00:16:49.320
She said, what?
她说，什么？

376
00:16:49.640 --> 00:16:51.760
And I said, I'm having contractions.
我说，我在宫缩。

377
00:16:51.940 --> 00:16:53.280
And she goes, okay, okay.
她说，好吧，好吧。

378
00:16:53.280 --> 00:16:56.320
Um, I will, uh, get back to you.
嗯，我……我待会儿再联系你。

379
00:16:56.800 --> 00:17:00.880
Literally three seconds later, my phone rings and it's Kent Sabornak.
就在三秒钟后，我的电话响了，是肯特·萨博纳克打来的。

380
00:17:01.020 --> 00:17:04.800
And I will never forget the first thing he said to me.
我永远不会忘记他对我说的第一句话。

381
00:17:04.980 --> 00:17:09.260
He said, hey, hey, Ange, uh, we having this baby today?
他说，嘿，嘿，安吉，呃，我们今天要生了吗？

382
00:17:10.260 --> 00:17:12.360
But like his voice cracked and went up.
但他说话的声音都变调了，音调很高。

383
00:17:12.480 --> 00:17:14.180
It's like, we having this baby today?
就像是，我们今天要生了吗？

384
00:17:14.420 --> 00:17:18.840
Because what you guys have to know is they were building a freaking Ferris wheel in the
因为你们必须知道的是，他们当时正在停车场里搭建一个该死的摩天轮。

385
00:17:18.840 --> 00:17:19.420
parking lot.
停车场。

386
00:17:19.700 --> 00:17:20.440
That's right.
没错。

387
00:17:20.440 --> 00:17:25.760
And to give you guys some context, this was all happening about three weeks before your
为了让大家了解背景，这一切发生在你预产期前大约三周，对吧？

388
00:17:25.760 --> 00:17:26.760
due date, right?
对。

389
00:17:26.960 --> 00:17:27.120
Yeah.
是的。

390
00:17:27.260 --> 00:17:29.840
We just had a few more days of filming with you.
我们本来只剩下几天就要拍完你的戏份了。

391
00:17:30.200 --> 00:17:34.640
Everyone just assumed that we would finish this episode and then you would go off on
大家都以为我们会拍完这一集，然后你就会去

392
00:17:34.640 --> 00:17:37.180
your summer hiatus and have your baby.
享受你的暑假，顺便把孩子生了。

393
00:17:37.980 --> 00:17:39.560
Kent thought he had time.
肯特以为他还有时间。

394
00:17:39.720 --> 00:17:44.640
But in reality, you are in the hospital and he was probably standing in the parking lot as
但实际上，你人在医院，而他当时可能正站在停车场里，看着

395
00:17:44.640 --> 00:17:47.700
they're assembling this Ferris wheel and he's freaking out.
他们组装那个摩天轮，他快急疯了。

396
00:17:48.220 --> 00:17:48.580
Yeah.
是的。

397
00:17:48.580 --> 00:17:52.040
How does Andy propose if Angela can't be there?
如果安吉拉不在场，安迪要怎么求婚？

398
00:17:52.340 --> 00:17:52.620
Yeah.
是啊。

399
00:17:53.180 --> 00:17:54.660
In front of the Ferris wheel.
在摩天轮前面。

400
00:17:55.320 --> 00:17:56.900
So I said, Kent, I don't know.
所以我说，肯特，我不知道。

401
00:17:57.000 --> 00:17:58.460
I don't know if I'm having this baby tonight.
我不知道今晚会不会生下这个孩子。

402
00:17:58.600 --> 00:18:00.940
And he said, well, would you keep me posted?
他说，好吧，那你随时告诉我情况好吗？

403
00:18:01.240 --> 00:18:02.360
And I said, sure.
我说，没问题。

404
00:18:03.060 --> 00:18:05.180
And it turned out to be false labor.
结果发现是假性宫缩。

405
00:18:05.380 --> 00:18:06.960
I was there till about two in the morning.
我在那儿一直待到凌晨两点左右。

406
00:18:07.180 --> 00:18:09.520
I did have to go work a half day the next day.
第二天我确实还得去上半天班。

407
00:18:09.520 --> 00:18:13.900
And let me tell you, Kent had already hired a stunt woman.
我跟你说，肯特已经雇了一位替身演员。

408
00:18:14.120 --> 00:18:15.540
Her name was Melissa Barker.
她叫梅丽莎·巴克。

409
00:18:15.640 --> 00:18:19.180
And she was to be my body double for the rest of this shoot.
在剩下的拍摄过程中，她将担任我的替身。

410
00:18:19.360 --> 00:18:23.880
They really wanted to try to make sure I did not have to work if I was not in a speaking
他们真的很想确保如果我没有台词的话，

411
00:18:23.880 --> 00:18:24.820
scene, right?
就不用工作，对吧？

412
00:18:25.020 --> 00:18:26.000
They would use Melissa.
他们会用梅丽莎。

413
00:18:26.480 --> 00:18:30.360
Angela, it was so weird to have her on set because she was dressed just like you.
安吉拉，片场有她在真的很奇怪，因为她穿得跟你一模一样。

414
00:18:30.480 --> 00:18:32.120
She had her hair done just like you.
她做的发型也跟你一模一样。

415
00:18:32.120 --> 00:18:34.840
From behind, she seriously looked like you.
从背后看，她看起来简直就是你。

416
00:18:35.000 --> 00:18:40.420
So yes, if there was a scene in the conference room and you were just not speaking, she would
所以没错，如果会议室里有一场戏，而你没有台词，她就会

417
00:18:40.420 --> 00:18:43.260
be sitting there and I would forget that she wasn't you.
坐在那里，我甚至会忘了她不是你。

418
00:18:43.740 --> 00:18:44.220
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

419
00:18:44.660 --> 00:18:47.460
Well, listen, this all happened on a Thursday night.
听着，这一切都发生在周四晚上。

420
00:18:47.660 --> 00:18:50.780
By Saturday, Kent sent the whole cast this email.
到了周六，肯特给全体演员发了这封邮件。

421
00:18:50.940 --> 00:18:52.340
Saturday, April 12th.
4月12日，星期六。

422
00:18:52.460 --> 00:18:56.040
Hey, you guys, our one-liner schedule will be coming out later tomorrow.
嘿，各位，我们的单行拍摄计划明天晚些时候会出来。

423
00:18:56.520 --> 00:19:01.960
Please be advised that we are trying to shoot Miss Angela Kinsey out next week so she can go
请注意，我们正努力在下周拍完安吉拉·金赛小姐的戏份，这样她就能

424
00:19:01.960 --> 00:19:04.960
rest easily for a full week before delivering her little girl.
在生下小女儿之前安心休息整整一周。

425
00:19:05.180 --> 00:19:09.340
And to accommodate this, Wednesday through Friday's schedule will be more grueling than
为了配合这一点，周三到周五的拍摄日程会比

426
00:19:09.340 --> 00:19:11.780
normal, especially Friday night's work.
平时更艰苦，尤其是周五晚上的工作。

427
00:19:11.940 --> 00:19:13.740
Think Ferris wheel and fireworks.
想想摩天轮和烟花。

428
00:19:14.140 --> 00:19:18.740
We will all take extra precautions to ensure Angela is comfortable and that she remains
我们都会采取额外的预防措施，确保安吉拉感到舒适，并确保她

429
00:19:18.740 --> 00:19:20.940
hydrated every single moment she is here.
在这里的每一刻都保持水分充足。

430
00:19:21.060 --> 00:19:23.460
So prepare for the walkie-talkie chatter.
所以做好准备听对讲机里的闲聊吧。

431
00:19:23.740 --> 00:19:25.840
Angela's going 10-1 again.
安吉拉又要去上厕所了。

432
00:19:28.980 --> 00:19:31.960
So yeah, I almost didn't make it to the parking lot.
所以没错，我差点没能走到停车场。

433
00:19:32.720 --> 00:19:34.040
Well, I'm glad you made it.
好吧，很高兴你成功了。

434
00:19:34.200 --> 00:19:35.060
I am too.
我也是。

435
00:19:35.960 --> 00:19:39.100
I do remember the whole cast and crew were a little worried.
我确实记得全体演职人员都有点担心。

436
00:19:39.260 --> 00:19:39.880
We were concerned.
我们很关心你。

437
00:19:40.040 --> 00:19:44.900
We wanted to make sure that we got your work done first so that you could leave.
我们想确保先完成你的工作，这样你就能离开。

438
00:19:45.120 --> 00:19:45.380
Yes.
是的。

439
00:19:45.480 --> 00:19:47.420
And I left and Melissa Barker stayed.
然后我离开了，梅丽莎·巴克留了下来。

440
00:19:47.640 --> 00:19:49.060
So thank you, Melissa Barker.
所以谢谢你，梅丽莎·巴克。

441
00:19:49.060 --> 00:19:54.420
And lady, now everyone is exiting the building, going into the parking lot.
女士们，现在每个人都在离开大楼，走向停车场。

442
00:19:54.820 --> 00:19:57.000
25 minutes, 52 seconds.
25分52秒。

443
00:19:57.320 --> 00:19:58.060
Ugg alert.
雪地靴警报。

444
00:19:58.700 --> 00:20:00.220
Who has the Uggs?
谁穿了雪地靴？

445
00:20:00.360 --> 00:20:03.180
Who has the warm, fuzzy Uggs on?
谁穿了那双暖和又毛茸茸的雪地靴？

446
00:20:03.300 --> 00:20:04.420
Who is this person?
这人是谁？

447
00:20:04.960 --> 00:20:05.680
It is me.
是我。

448
00:20:07.540 --> 00:20:11.420
And this starts a theme for this episode where they just gave up with me.
这开启了这一集的一个主题，就是他们彻底放弃管我了。

449
00:20:11.580 --> 00:20:13.260
They were like, just keep her comfortable.
他们当时想的是，只要让她舒服就行。

450
00:20:13.260 --> 00:20:19.560
And I feel like in almost every shot, you can see my belly and I'm wearing Uggs and no one cares.
我觉得几乎在每一个镜头里，你都能看到我的肚子，而且我穿着雪地靴，根本没人管。

451
00:20:19.860 --> 00:20:20.580
You know what?
你知道吗？

452
00:20:20.660 --> 00:20:25.000
I remember watching Seinfeld when Julia Louis-Dreyfus was pregnant.
我记得看《宋飞正传》时，朱莉娅·路易斯-德瑞弗斯正好怀孕了。

453
00:20:25.060 --> 00:20:28.540
And there were a few times where I feel like it was the same.
有几次我觉得情况是一样的。

454
00:20:28.820 --> 00:20:29.860
They were like, you know what?
他们当时就像是，你知道吗？

455
00:20:29.860 --> 00:20:31.400
We all know she's pregnant.
我们都知道她怀孕了。

456
00:20:31.580 --> 00:20:34.560
We're pretending like she's not pregnant because her character's not pregnant.
但我们假装她没怀孕，因为她演的角色没怀孕。

457
00:20:34.820 --> 00:20:37.360
Let's just, we're all in it together, folks.
大家伙儿，我们就一起配合演下去吧。

458
00:20:37.660 --> 00:20:37.940
Yeah.
没错。

459
00:20:38.100 --> 00:20:39.280
We're just giving up.
我们干脆放弃挣扎了。

460
00:20:39.920 --> 00:20:40.440
Exactly.
确实。

461
00:20:41.740 --> 00:20:45.680
Well, Michael is very disappointed that there is not an anti-gravity machine,
迈克尔对没有反重力装置感到非常失望，

462
00:20:45.680 --> 00:20:47.980
but he is impressed with the Ferris wheel.
但他对摩天轮印象深刻。

463
00:20:48.600 --> 00:20:49.080
Yeah.
是啊。

464
00:20:49.180 --> 00:20:55.400
And there's a bouncy house, which by the way, poor Brian in the heat had to jump up and down
还有一个充气城堡，顺便说一下，可怜的布莱恩在高温下不得不跳来跳去，

465
00:20:55.400 --> 00:20:56.520
in over and over.
一遍又一遍。

466
00:20:56.620 --> 00:20:58.140
And it was so hot in there.
里面真的太热了。

467
00:20:58.200 --> 00:21:03.840
And there's deleted scenes of him jumping and jumping and it didn't even make it in the episode.
还有他跳个不停的删减片段，甚至都没剪进正片里。

468
00:21:04.120 --> 00:21:04.940
I know.
我知道。

469
00:21:04.940 --> 00:21:09.840
So this is also when Pam clocks the fireworks and she realizes,
所以这也是帕姆注意到烟花的时候，她意识到，

470
00:21:10.420 --> 00:21:13.160
oh my gosh, is Jim going to propose tonight?
天哪，吉姆今晚要向我求婚吗？

471
00:21:13.400 --> 00:21:14.340
She's so excited.
她太兴奋了。

472
00:21:14.660 --> 00:21:16.760
Lady, I thought you were so good in this episode.
女士，我觉得你这一集演得太棒了。

473
00:21:17.000 --> 00:21:20.820
I thought your performance was so subtle and the emotion was so there.
我觉得你的表演非常细腻，情感表达也很到位。

474
00:21:20.820 --> 00:21:23.200
I just thought it was a beautiful, beautiful job.
我觉得你完成得非常、非常出色。

475
00:21:23.420 --> 00:21:24.000
Oh my gosh.
天哪。

476
00:21:24.180 --> 00:21:25.180
Thank you so much.
太感谢你了。

477
00:21:25.300 --> 00:21:25.660
Yeah.
是啊。

478
00:21:25.660 --> 00:21:28.320
We had a fan question from Sophie F.
我们收到一个来自苏菲·F的粉丝提问。

479
00:21:28.520 --> 00:21:31.820
Did you get to go on the rides while you weren't filming?
你们在不拍戏的时候能去玩那些游乐设施吗？

480
00:21:32.520 --> 00:21:33.000
No.
不能。

481
00:21:33.260 --> 00:21:39.860
For insurance purposes, they were not going to let cast members who were not scripted to
出于保险考虑，他们不会让剧本里没写要坐摩天轮的演员，

482
00:21:39.860 --> 00:21:42.080
be on the Ferris wheel get on the Ferris wheel.
去坐摩天轮。

483
00:21:42.720 --> 00:21:44.680
They wanted me nowhere near that thing.
他们想让我离那玩意儿越远越好。

484
00:21:44.900 --> 00:21:47.600
They were like, hey, big pregnant lady, you're already freaking us out.
他们就像是，嘿，大肚婆，你已经够让我们提心吊胆的了。

485
00:21:47.860 --> 00:21:48.460
Stay away.
离远点。

486
00:21:49.020 --> 00:21:53.640
I remember talking to Jen Salotta about it and she said, oh my gosh, all the writers were
我记得和简·萨洛塔聊过这件事，她说，天哪，所有的编剧都

487
00:21:53.640 --> 00:21:54.420
like so excited.
特别兴奋。

488
00:21:54.580 --> 00:21:56.400
They're like, we're going to ride the Ferris wheel.
他们说，我们要去坐摩天轮。

489
00:21:56.600 --> 00:21:57.620
It's going to be so fun.
那一定会很有趣。

490
00:21:57.860 --> 00:21:59.840
And then none of them ever rode it.
结果他们谁也没去坐。

491
00:22:00.180 --> 00:22:00.540
No.
没有。

492
00:22:00.680 --> 00:22:04.660
I remember when they had the bouncy houses, whenever we had a bouncy house, you know,
我记得当他们有充气城堡的时候，每当我们有充气城堡，你知道的，

493
00:22:04.720 --> 00:22:06.800
there'd be someone to be like, oh, could the kids come by today?
总会有人问，哦，今天能让孩子们过来玩吗？

494
00:22:06.900 --> 00:22:07.440
They're like, nope.
他们会说，不行。

495
00:22:08.380 --> 00:22:09.780
No one get on those things.
谁都不许上去。

496
00:22:10.220 --> 00:22:12.740
Well, two people who were allowed to get on the Ferris wheel.
不过，有两个人是被允许坐摩天轮的。

497
00:22:13.100 --> 00:22:15.860
I remember when they shot this, Angela, these poor guys.
安吉拉，我记得他们拍这一幕的时候，那几个可怜的家伙。

498
00:22:16.040 --> 00:22:18.140
Do you know how many times they had to go around that Ferris wheel?
你知道他们在那摩天轮上转了多少圈吗？

499
00:22:18.360 --> 00:22:21.780
Just as a person who rode the Jurassic Park ride for 12 hours,
作为一个坐了12个小时侏罗纪公园游乐设施的人，

500
00:22:21.780 --> 00:22:23.840
you know how old it gets.
你知道那有多无聊。

501
00:22:24.080 --> 00:22:25.500
It's a trigger for you.
这对你来说是个触发点。

502
00:22:25.600 --> 00:22:25.920
It is.
确实是。

503
00:22:26.160 --> 00:22:26.340
It's a trigger.
是个触发点。

504
00:22:26.540 --> 00:22:29.320
And I watched them ride that Ferris wheel for about an hour.
我看着他们坐那个摩天轮坐了大约一个小时。

505
00:22:29.540 --> 00:22:31.960
I don't understand how they weren't completely sick.
我不明白他们怎么没被转得晕头转向。

506
00:22:32.140 --> 00:22:36.580
When you watch the episode, you see one scene between Michael and Holly on the Ferris wheel,
当你观看这一集时，你会看到迈克尔和霍莉在摩天轮上的一场戏，

507
00:22:36.660 --> 00:22:37.240
but there are more.
但其实还有更多。

508
00:22:37.420 --> 00:22:40.040
And they're in the deleted scenes and they're really cute.
它们在删减片段里，而且真的非常可爱。

509
00:22:40.060 --> 00:22:41.680
So they were in there for a while.
所以他们在上面待了挺久。

510
00:22:42.100 --> 00:22:43.360
Yeah, I remember that.
是啊，我记得那个。

511
00:22:43.620 --> 00:22:48.400
One of the Ferris wheel scenes that I love is Michael is telling Holly a story.
我最喜欢的摩天轮片段之一是迈克尔给霍莉讲故事。

512
00:22:48.400 --> 00:22:51.940
And right as they get to the top of the Ferris wheel, she shakes the cart,
就在他们到达摩天轮顶端时，她摇晃了一下车厢，

513
00:22:52.100 --> 00:22:53.940
like kind of leans forward so it rocks.
就像是身体前倾让它晃动起来。

514
00:22:53.940 --> 00:22:55.420
And he goes, oh my God.
然后他说，天哪。

515
00:22:55.640 --> 00:22:57.360
And then they both start laughing.
接着他们俩都笑了起来。

516
00:22:57.360 --> 00:22:58.520
And he's like, you got me.
他说，你吓到我了。

517
00:22:58.640 --> 00:23:00.380
You know, it's so cute.
你知道，这太可爱了。

518
00:23:00.520 --> 00:23:02.320
It's like something Michael would have done.
这就像迈克尔会做的事。

519
00:23:02.540 --> 00:23:02.800
Yes.
没错。

520
00:23:02.980 --> 00:23:05.420
That probably would annoy anyone else.
换作别人可能会觉得烦。

521
00:23:05.600 --> 00:23:06.040
Yeah.
是啊。

522
00:23:06.240 --> 00:23:07.900
Because that's an annoying thing to do.
因为那确实是个讨人厌的举动。

523
00:23:08.060 --> 00:23:08.780
It really is.
确实如此。

524
00:23:09.060 --> 00:23:09.420
Yeah.
是啊。

525
00:23:09.600 --> 00:23:11.580
And he's delighted by it.
但他却乐在其中。

526
00:23:11.880 --> 00:23:12.560
So cute.
太可爱了。

527
00:23:12.560 --> 00:23:18.440
Well, when they finally get off the Ferris wheel, Holly catches Mose, Dwight, and Meredith
好吧，当他们终于从摩天轮上下来时，霍莉抓住了莫斯、德怀特和梅雷迪思，

528
00:23:18.440 --> 00:23:20.120
doing something to her car.
他们正在对她的车做些什么。

529
00:23:20.240 --> 00:23:21.280
What are you doing to my car?
你们在对我的车做什么？

530
00:23:21.480 --> 00:23:25.940
Well, what they're doing is putting a raccoon inside of it because they're still hazing her.
其实他们是在往车里放一只浣熊，因为他们还在欺负她。

531
00:23:26.700 --> 00:23:27.040
Yeah.
是啊。

532
00:23:27.500 --> 00:23:32.800
And you guys might be curious, why is Meredith involved with Dwight and Moses hazing?
你们可能会好奇，为什么梅雷迪思会参与德怀特和莫斯的恶作剧？

533
00:23:33.240 --> 00:23:37.260
We learn in a deleted scene that Meredith is not a fan of Holly.
我们在一个删减片段中了解到，梅雷迪思不喜欢霍莉。

534
00:23:37.620 --> 00:23:38.760
Can you guys play the clip?
你们能播放一下那个片段吗？

535
00:23:39.440 --> 00:23:40.860
I think that makes us neighbors.
我想我们算是邻居。

536
00:23:41.120 --> 00:23:42.080
It's a couple streets over.
就在隔几条街的地方。

537
00:23:42.560 --> 00:23:46.580
Oh, maybe you can show me some of the fun hangouts or where to get my nails done.
哦，也许你可以带我去一些好玩的地方，或者告诉我哪里可以做美甲。

538
00:23:46.880 --> 00:23:46.930
Sure.
当然。

539
00:23:47.020 --> 00:23:47.940
That sounds fun.
听起来很有趣。

540
00:23:48.300 --> 00:23:48.740
Great.
太好了。

541
00:23:49.980 --> 00:23:51.120
I hate that bitch.
我讨厌那个婊子。

542
00:23:51.560 --> 00:23:52.860
I want to cut her face.
我想划烂她的脸。

543
00:23:53.780 --> 00:23:55.480
It just comes out of nowhere.
这简直是没来由的。

544
00:23:55.840 --> 00:23:57.760
Holly is like, hey, I think we're neighbors.
霍莉说，嘿，我想我们是邻居。

545
00:23:57.920 --> 00:23:59.160
Maybe we could do stuff together.
也许我们可以一起做点什么。

546
00:23:59.360 --> 00:24:03.260
And then immediately as she walks away, Meredith is like, I hate that bitch.
然后她刚走开，梅雷迪思就说，我讨厌那个婊子。

547
00:24:03.480 --> 00:24:08.340
And Dwight overhears this and he's like, uh-huh, I have an accomplice.
德怀特听到了，心想，嗯哼，我有同伙了。

548
00:24:08.440 --> 00:24:11.540
And there's all these really fun scenes between Dwight and Meredith
德怀特和梅雷迪思之间有很多非常有趣的场景，

549
00:24:11.540 --> 00:24:14.080
as they plan out all these different pranks.
他们策划了各种各样的恶作剧。

550
00:24:14.320 --> 00:24:14.920
They're great.
他们太棒了。

551
00:24:15.100 --> 00:24:15.920
They're on the DVD.
它们都在DVD里。

552
00:24:16.280 --> 00:24:21.520
And I texted with Kate because in the script, there's some direction I want to read to you.
我给凯特发了短信，因为剧本里有些导演说明我想读给你听。

553
00:24:21.640 --> 00:24:23.760
It says, Michael leads Holly away.
上面写着，迈克尔把霍莉带走。

554
00:24:24.060 --> 00:24:29.780
In the background, Dwight casually opens Holly's car door, releasing the badger.
背景里，德怀特随意地打开了霍莉的车门，放出了獾。

555
00:24:29.780 --> 00:24:35.060
Then there's an asterisk and it says the raccoon instantly attacks Meredith.
然后有个星号，写着浣熊立刻袭击了梅雷迪思。

556
00:24:35.360 --> 00:24:37.700
So I was like, is it a badger or is it a raccoon?
所以我当时就在想，到底是獾还是浣熊？

557
00:24:37.820 --> 00:24:43.080
But either way, I texted Kate and I said, did you have to film getting attacked by a raccoon?
但不管怎样，我给凯特发了短信，问她：你真的拍了被浣熊袭击的戏吗？

558
00:24:43.680 --> 00:24:49.520
Jen Salata said the original outline for the script had them putting a badger in the car.
简·萨拉塔说剧本的原始大纲里是让他们把一只獾放进车里。

559
00:24:49.720 --> 00:24:50.240
Oh.
哦。

560
00:24:50.640 --> 00:24:51.940
Instead of a raccoon.
而不是浣熊。

561
00:24:51.940 --> 00:24:57.280
But they couldn't find a trained badger to attack Meredith.
但他们找不到能训练去袭击梅雷迪思的獾。

562
00:24:57.720 --> 00:24:58.580
Well, who knew?
好吧，谁能想到呢？

563
00:24:59.040 --> 00:25:03.320
So Kent got a raccoon from this place called Critters of the Cinema.
所以肯特从一家叫“电影小动物”的地方找来了一只浣熊。

564
00:25:03.620 --> 00:25:12.240
But then they realized that even a raccoon is not really trained well enough for an attack scene,
但后来他们意识到，即使是浣熊也没有训练到能拍袭击戏的程度，

565
00:25:12.340 --> 00:25:17.720
at least not to the point where they felt like they wanted Kate to have a raccoon on her.
至少没到他们觉得可以让凯特身上爬满浣熊的地步。

566
00:25:17.720 --> 00:25:25.500
So they hired a stunt double to do it, but then they realized the best way to do it was maybe with CGI.
所以他们雇了替身演员来拍，但后来发现最好的办法或许是后期特效。

567
00:25:26.060 --> 00:25:33.940
So they did a shot of Kate just flailing around as if she was being attacked by a raccoon.
于是他们拍了凯特在那儿乱挥乱舞，假装被浣熊袭击的样子。

568
00:25:34.040 --> 00:25:36.580
But in the end, the whole thing got cut.
但最后，整段戏都被剪掉了。

569
00:25:36.880 --> 00:25:37.180
Yeah.
是啊。

570
00:25:37.580 --> 00:25:43.780
However, Kate said that there is a scene later where she has scratch marks on her face.
不过凯特说，后来有个场景她脸上确实有抓痕。

571
00:25:43.780 --> 00:25:44.260
Yeah.
没错。

572
00:25:44.480 --> 00:25:48.560
I texted Kate and she said they filmed her screaming and running around.
我给凯特发了短信，她说他们拍了她尖叫和乱跑的镜头。

573
00:25:48.620 --> 00:25:50.840
Then they didn't end up using any of it.
结果最后一段都没用上。

574
00:25:50.940 --> 00:25:54.960
And she said, once again, the animals have better representation than me.
她说，又一次，动物的待遇比我好。

575
00:25:56.120 --> 00:25:57.240
That's very funny.
那太搞笑了。

576
00:25:57.240 --> 00:26:00.400
Because she always gets roped into these animal attacks.
因为她总是被卷进这些动物袭击事件里。

577
00:26:00.880 --> 00:26:06.400
I found an old interview that Mike Schur did as Moe's talking about the raccoon.
我找到了迈克·舒尔以莫斯的身份谈论那只浣熊的旧采访。

578
00:26:06.600 --> 00:26:07.360
Oh, yeah?
哦，是吗？

579
00:26:07.580 --> 00:26:09.900
This is what Moe's has to say about it.
这就是莫斯对此的评价。

580
00:26:09.900 --> 00:26:12.580
Quote, I love the raccoon.
引用如下：我爱这只浣熊。

581
00:26:12.740 --> 00:26:17.360
The raccoon's name is Chair because when I found him, he was eating a chair.
这只浣熊叫“椅子”，因为我发现它的时候，它正在吃一把椅子。

582
00:26:17.980 --> 00:26:20.380
He has a brother named Trampoline Leg.
它有个兄弟叫“蹦床腿”。

583
00:26:20.900 --> 00:26:22.300
Chair is very nice.
“椅子”人很好。

584
00:26:22.540 --> 00:26:24.380
I made sure Chair got home safely.
我确保了“椅子”安全到家。

585
00:26:24.720 --> 00:26:29.300
Chair would never hurt anyone except once Chair bit my cheek when I was feeding him a lemon.
“椅子”从不伤害任何人，除了有一次我喂它柠檬时，它咬了我的脸颊。

586
00:26:29.960 --> 00:26:30.340
End quote.
引用结束。

587
00:26:30.880 --> 00:26:32.580
Moe's the conversationaliSt.
莫斯真是个健谈的人。

588
00:26:33.060 --> 00:26:35.980
Michael really comes to Holly's defense, you know?
迈克尔真的挺身维护霍莉了，你知道吗？

589
00:26:35.980 --> 00:26:43.260
He tells them they should be ashamed of themselves and that Holly is the best thing to happen to this company since World War II.
他告诉他们应该为自己感到羞耻，还说霍莉是二战以来这家公司发生过的最好的事。

590
00:26:43.460 --> 00:26:49.600
And she is going to be so appreciative that she touches Michael's arm and it kind of lingers there for a second.
她非常感激，于是摸了摸迈克尔的手臂，手在那儿停留了一秒。

591
00:26:49.840 --> 00:26:50.820
For a second?
停留了一秒？

592
00:26:50.820 --> 00:26:51.600
I counted.
我数了。

593
00:26:52.360 --> 00:26:53.400
Nine seconds.
九秒。

594
00:26:53.800 --> 00:26:54.520
Count that out.
你数数看。

595
00:26:54.520 --> 00:27:06.540
One, two, three, four, five, six, seven, eight, nine.
一，二，三，四，五，六，七，八，九。

596
00:27:07.020 --> 00:27:07.900
Come on!
得了吧！

597
00:27:08.060 --> 00:27:09.920
That's a lingering touch right there!
那可是实打实的深情触碰！

598
00:27:10.480 --> 00:27:12.500
This talking head broke my heart.
这段采访镜头看得我心碎。

599
00:27:14.720 --> 00:27:16.100
He's so excited.
他太兴奋了。

600
00:27:16.400 --> 00:27:18.020
This is so good.
这太棒了。

601
00:27:18.280 --> 00:27:19.260
He says,
他说，

602
00:27:19.400 --> 00:27:20.340
Did you see that?
你看到了吗？

603
00:27:20.460 --> 00:27:21.320
Did you see that?
你看到了吗？

604
00:27:21.500 --> 00:27:24.000
He's kind of talking to the documentarian crew, right?
他其实是在跟纪录片摄制组说话，对吧？

605
00:27:24.000 --> 00:27:26.740
He's like, you know, Jan didn't believe in affection.
他大概是说，你知道的，简不相信亲昵。

606
00:27:26.740 --> 00:27:31.440
So sometimes he just doesn't know how to react when a girl touches him, but he really likes it.
所以有时候当女孩碰他时，他不知道该怎么反应，但他其实很喜欢。

607
00:27:32.840 --> 00:27:34.940
Holly is so perfect for him.
霍莉真是太适合他了。

608
00:27:35.160 --> 00:27:35.820
I know.
我知道。

609
00:27:36.260 --> 00:27:38.400
But there's a problem at the party, Angela.
但是派对上有个问题，安吉拉。

610
00:27:38.600 --> 00:27:41.240
I'm sorry to tell you, the barbecue sauce is out.
很抱歉告诉你，烧烤酱用完了。

611
00:27:41.680 --> 00:27:42.300
Oh, yeah.
哦，是吗。

612
00:27:42.860 --> 00:27:45.240
By the way, do you know who's doing the barbecuing?
顺便问一下，你知道是谁在负责烧烤吗？

613
00:27:45.500 --> 00:27:51.860
It's Gino and Leo from Vance Refrigeration, played by Gene Stepnitsky and Lee Eisenberg, our two writers.
是范斯制冷公司的吉诺和里奥，由我们的两位编剧吉恩·斯特普尼茨基和李·艾森伯格饰演。

614
00:27:53.540 --> 00:27:55.280
They were perfect as those guys.
他们演那两个角色真是绝了。

615
00:27:55.540 --> 00:27:59.380
I don't know if that's a compliment or not, but they were great as those two idiots.
我不知道这算不算夸奖，但他们演那两个白痴演得真棒。

616
00:27:59.920 --> 00:28:03.700
Well, Phyllis tells Kevin, you need to go get more barbecue sauce.
菲利斯告诉凯文，你需要去多拿点烧烤酱。

617
00:28:03.880 --> 00:28:04.500
Well, guess what?
结果呢？

618
00:28:04.620 --> 00:28:07.900
There was a deleted scene where Angela's like, Phyllis, I got it.
有一个删减片段是安吉拉说，菲利斯，我去拿吧。

619
00:28:07.980 --> 00:28:08.500
No problem.
没问题。

620
00:28:08.900 --> 00:28:09.980
She's like, really?
菲利斯说，真的吗？

621
00:28:10.140 --> 00:28:11.980
She's like, yeah, I'll get the barbecue sauce.
