00:51:47.940 --> 00:51:52.460
So they write this great joke that she refuses to stand, which is just so funny, which I'm
于是他们写了这个绝妙的笑话，说她拒绝站起来，这真的太搞笑了，如果不是因为你无法站起来的问题，

1081
00:51:52.460 --> 00:51:56.800
not sure they would have thought of if not for the problem of you not being able to stand.
我不确定他们是否会想到这个点子。

1082
00:51:57.140 --> 00:51:57.580
Yeah.
是啊。

1083
00:51:58.000 --> 00:51:58.900
I love that.
我喜欢这个。

1084
00:51:58.900 --> 00:52:02.660
I loved when he was like, will you marry me?
我喜欢他说“你愿意嫁给我吗？”的时候。

1085
00:52:02.920 --> 00:52:05.060
And my character's like, okay.
而我的角色说“好吧”。

1086
00:52:05.600 --> 00:52:08.100
And then he's like, into the microphone, babe.
然后他说“对着麦克风说，宝贝”。

1087
00:52:09.120 --> 00:52:10.980
I'm like, I said, okay.
我说“我说了，好吧”。

1088
00:52:12.160 --> 00:52:17.900
Can you imagine if you asked someone to marry them and their answer was, I said, okay.
你能想象如果你向某人求婚，对方的回答是“我说了，好吧”吗？

1089
00:52:18.120 --> 00:52:19.160
With a bite to it.
还带着点刺儿。

1090
00:52:19.260 --> 00:52:20.260
I said, okay.
我说，好吧。

1091
00:52:20.500 --> 00:52:21.960
And the crowd goes wild.
然后人群沸腾了。

1092
00:52:22.240 --> 00:52:22.800
I know.
我知道。

1093
00:52:23.060 --> 00:52:25.420
Kelly runs up and says, can I be a bridesmaid?
Kelly跑过来问，我可以当伴娘吗？

1094
00:52:25.680 --> 00:52:26.100
Oh, yeah.
哦，当然。

1095
00:52:26.500 --> 00:52:27.860
And Angela's like, no.
然后Angela说，不行。

1096
00:52:29.100 --> 00:52:33.600
In the script, there was an Angela talking head after the proposal.
在剧本里，求婚之后还有一个Angela的单人采访镜头。

1097
00:52:33.980 --> 00:52:39.440
First of all, in the script, she starts off the talking head by showing off the engagement
首先，在剧本里，她一开始是在采访中炫耀她的订婚

1098
00:52:39.440 --> 00:52:39.800
ring.
戒指。

1099
00:52:40.380 --> 00:52:48.220
It is written that it is a giant yellow diamond with a huge inclusion, if you were wondering.
剧本里写着那是一颗巨大的黄钻，里面有个巨大的内含物，如果你好奇的话。

1100
00:52:48.900 --> 00:52:49.620
Okay.
好吧。

1101
00:52:50.140 --> 00:52:52.700
And then here's Angela's talking head.
接下来是安吉拉的采访镜头。

1102
00:52:52.920 --> 00:52:55.280
I don't like options in life.
我不喜欢生活中有选择。

1103
00:52:55.680 --> 00:52:57.760
Options make me jittery and crazy.
选择会让我焦躁不安、抓狂。

1104
00:52:57.760 --> 00:52:59.460
See, like I just had a cup of green tea.
你看，就像我刚才喝了一杯绿茶。

1105
00:52:59.840 --> 00:53:00.860
I like order.
我喜欢秩序。

1106
00:53:01.200 --> 00:53:02.240
I like answers.
我喜欢确定的答案。

1107
00:53:02.580 --> 00:53:04.900
I like knowing this is where you'll work.
我喜欢知道这就是你工作的地方。

1108
00:53:05.040 --> 00:53:06.200
This is what you'll wear.
这就是你要穿的衣服。

1109
00:53:06.500 --> 00:53:08.080
This is what you'll come home to.
这就是你回家后面对的一切。

1110
00:53:08.580 --> 00:53:08.920
Great.
太棒了。

1111
00:53:09.160 --> 00:53:09.480
Done.
搞定。

1112
00:53:09.760 --> 00:53:10.400
Let's get married.
我们结婚吧。

1113
00:53:10.540 --> 00:53:11.040
I love you too.
我也爱你。

1114
00:53:11.720 --> 00:53:12.380
Says it all.
一切尽在不言中。

1115
00:53:12.780 --> 00:53:14.000
That's all you need to know.
这就是你需要知道的全部。

1116
00:53:14.700 --> 00:53:16.180
She's ordering her life.
她在规划自己的人生。

1117
00:53:16.320 --> 00:53:18.040
And I think Dwight is too unpredictable.
而且我觉得德怀特太不可预测了。

1118
00:53:18.440 --> 00:53:19.780
You just don't know with him.
你永远摸不透他。

1119
00:53:19.900 --> 00:53:20.920
And she can't control him.
而且她控制不了他。

1120
00:53:20.920 --> 00:53:24.100
And, you know, she came home to a dead, frozen cat.
还有，你知道的，她回家时发现了一只死掉的冻猫。

1121
00:53:24.120 --> 00:53:26.540
And she'll have none of those shenanigans ever again.
她再也不想经历那种荒唐事了。

1122
00:53:26.820 --> 00:53:28.040
Well, certainly not with Andy.
嗯，至少和安迪在一起不会。

1123
00:53:28.320 --> 00:53:30.280
She is the boss of Andy for sure.
她绝对是安迪的老板。

1124
00:53:31.040 --> 00:53:34.120
This is a very comfortable, predictable relationship.
这是一段非常舒适、可预测的关系。

1125
00:53:34.680 --> 00:53:35.340
That's right.
没错。

1126
00:53:35.340 --> 00:53:36.220
On her terMs.
按她的条件来。

1127
00:53:36.220 --> 00:53:36.940
Completely.
完全如此。

1128
00:53:37.800 --> 00:53:39.900
Well, guys, Jim puts the ring away.
伙计们，吉姆把戒指收起来了。

1129
00:53:40.140 --> 00:53:40.700
Oh, I know.
噢，我知道。

1130
00:53:40.720 --> 00:53:46.480
He is not going to propose on the same night in the same place that Andy proposes.
他才不会在安迪求婚的同一个晚上、同一个地点求婚呢。

1131
00:53:46.640 --> 00:53:48.760
And Pam seems to be a little bit upset.
帕姆看起来有点难过。

1132
00:53:49.020 --> 00:53:51.640
I have to say, good call, Jim.
我得说，吉姆做得对。

1133
00:53:52.060 --> 00:53:52.800
Well, yeah.
嗯，确实。

1134
00:53:53.040 --> 00:53:55.440
I mean, Pam is upset, but she's got to know.
我是说，帕姆虽然难过，但她应该明白。

1135
00:53:55.840 --> 00:53:56.200
Wait.
等等。

1136
00:53:56.680 --> 00:53:58.340
Jim is like a smart guy.
吉姆是个聪明人。

1137
00:53:58.340 --> 00:54:04.400
And there's no way he would propose to me after that crazy overture from Andy in front of everyone.
在安迪当众做出那种疯狂的求婚举动后，他绝不可能向我求婚。

1138
00:54:04.640 --> 00:54:10.480
You don't want that as a part of your engagement story when you go out to dinner and all that jazz.
当你出去吃饭或者做其他类似事情时，你可不想把那种场面作为你订婚故事的一部分。

1139
00:54:10.700 --> 00:54:13.360
And also, I do want to say, I don't know.
另外，我得说，我不知道。

1140
00:54:13.540 --> 00:54:17.500
Did Jim have time to, like, call her parents and ask for her hand in marriage?
吉姆有时间给她的父母打电话请求准许他娶她吗？

1141
00:54:17.620 --> 00:54:20.460
Because this seems a little traditional to me.
因为这对我来说似乎有点传统了。

1142
00:54:20.740 --> 00:54:26.240
There is a scene in the script where Jim is trying to call Pam's mom and is leaving her a message.
剧本里有一场戏，吉姆试图给帕姆的妈妈打电话并留了言。

1143
00:54:26.240 --> 00:54:29.280
And he's just like, hey, I've tried you a few times.
他当时说，嘿，我试着联系过你几次了。

1144
00:54:29.280 --> 00:54:30.660
Just need to get a hold of you.
只是需要联系上你。

1145
00:54:30.840 --> 00:54:33.360
So Jim was trying to call your mom.
所以吉姆确实尝试过给你妈妈打电话。

1146
00:54:33.940 --> 00:54:34.420
Okay.
好吧。

1147
00:54:34.940 --> 00:54:35.420
Yeah.
是的。

1148
00:54:35.740 --> 00:54:36.740
I like that.
我喜欢这样。

1149
00:54:36.980 --> 00:54:39.480
I don't know who's more bummed, Pam or Dwight.
我不知道谁更沮丧，帕姆还是德怀特。

1150
00:54:39.900 --> 00:54:41.120
I think Dwight.
我觉得是德怀特。

1151
00:54:41.560 --> 00:54:42.040
Yeah.
是啊。

1152
00:54:42.760 --> 00:54:44.220
He's really, really sad.
他真的非常非常难过。

1153
00:54:44.520 --> 00:54:47.120
He actually says, well, it's my own fault.
他甚至说，好吧，这是我自找的。

1154
00:54:47.560 --> 00:54:48.040
Yeah.
是啊。

1155
00:54:48.520 --> 00:54:50.360
But Pam is pretty bummed.
但帕姆挺沮丧的。

1156
00:54:50.520 --> 00:54:54.180
And it's right at this moment that Toby is going to try to take a picture with her.
就在这时，托比打算试着跟她合张影。

1157
00:54:55.060 --> 00:54:55.540
Yeah.
是啊。

1158
00:54:56.000 --> 00:55:02.240
He's got this fancy camera, which I do remember there's a whole deleted scene where he has
他带了台高级相机，我记得有一整段删减戏份，讲的是他

1159
00:55:02.240 --> 00:55:05.320
purchased this fancy camera suddenly.
突然买了这台高级相机。

1160
00:55:06.360 --> 00:55:07.980
It's really funny, you guys.
真的很有趣，伙计们。

1161
00:55:08.120 --> 00:55:11.560
I filmed it and I texted it to Paul because it made me laugh so hard.
我拍了下来，还发短信给保罗，因为这让我笑得不行。

1162
00:55:11.760 --> 00:55:15.100
He comes in with this camera and he asked Jim.
他带着相机走进来，问了吉姆。

1163
00:55:15.300 --> 00:55:16.140
He's like, hey, picture?
他说，嘿，拍张照吗？

1164
00:55:16.700 --> 00:55:18.600
And Jim and Pam are at reception talking.
当时吉姆和帕姆正在前台聊天。

1165
00:55:18.840 --> 00:55:19.900
And Jim and Pam are like, sure.
吉姆和帕姆说，好啊。

1166
00:55:19.900 --> 00:55:23.720
And they start posing for Toby to take pictures of them.
于是他们开始摆姿势让托比给他们拍照。

1167
00:55:23.860 --> 00:55:26.380
And they're like, smiley, silly one, crazy one.
他们还说，来个微笑的，来个搞怪的，再来个疯狂的。

1168
00:55:26.780 --> 00:55:29.420
And like, Toby is like, oh, God.
托比当时就觉得，天哪。

1169
00:55:29.480 --> 00:55:30.380
And he just walks away.
然后他就走开了。

1170
00:55:30.540 --> 00:55:31.580
It's so funny.
太搞笑了。

1171
00:55:31.580 --> 00:55:36.380
But he's clearly gone out and he's pretending like he bought it for Costa Rica.
但他显然是特意去买的，还假装是为了去哥斯达黎加才买的。

1172
00:55:36.560 --> 00:55:40.520
But the truth is he's bought this very fancy camera so he could get a picture with Pam.
但事实是，他买这台高级相机就是为了能和帕姆合影。

1173
00:55:40.520 --> 00:55:42.840
Pam, it's finally going to happen.
帕姆，这一刻终于要来了。

1174
00:55:43.360 --> 00:55:43.480
Yeah.
是啊。

1175
00:55:43.960 --> 00:55:45.180
Meredith takes a picture.
梅雷迪斯拍了一张。

1176
00:55:45.640 --> 00:55:47.960
She says, Pam, your smile is weird.
她说，帕姆，你的笑容好奇怪。

1177
00:55:49.040 --> 00:55:52.460
She's distracted by her non-proposal that just happened.
她正因为刚才发生的“非求婚”事件而心不在焉。

1178
00:55:52.880 --> 00:55:54.500
But Toby is delighted.
但托比却乐在其中。

1179
00:55:54.940 --> 00:55:59.760
You see him later just like sitting and scrolling through these pictures of him and Pam.
后来你看到他坐在那儿，翻看着他和帕姆的合影。

1180
00:56:00.120 --> 00:56:06.100
Right about this time, Michael gets back to the party and Holly tells him all about what happened.
就在这时，迈克尔回到了派对，霍莉把刚才发生的一切都告诉了他。

1181
00:56:06.520 --> 00:56:08.360
Andy proposed to an accountant.
安迪向一名会计求婚了。

1182
00:56:08.680 --> 00:56:12.220
And Michael says, well, it could have been Oscar or Angela, really.
迈克尔说，好吧，其实奥斯卡或安吉拉都有可能。

1183
00:56:13.080 --> 00:56:13.680
Yes.
没错。

1184
00:56:14.000 --> 00:56:16.020
He could see either one happening.
他觉得这两种情况都有可能发生。

1185
00:56:16.520 --> 00:56:19.480
And that's when Holly opens the door.
就在这时，霍莉打开了门。

1186
00:56:19.900 --> 00:56:26.200
She says, gosh, even after all these ribs and this whole party, I'm still a little hungry.
她说，天哪，吃了这么多排骨和参加完派对，我还是有点饿。

1187
00:56:26.360 --> 00:56:28.060
I thought maybe I'd go get some dessert.
我想也许该去吃点甜点。

1188
00:56:28.660 --> 00:56:32.120
Michael says, oh, you should go to the glider diner.
迈克尔说，哦，你应该去滑翔机餐馆。

1189
00:56:32.240 --> 00:56:33.200
Ask Stanley about it.
问问斯坦利就知道了。

1190
00:56:33.260 --> 00:56:34.460
He goes there all the time.
他经常去那儿。

1191
00:56:34.640 --> 00:56:37.120
And she's like, oh, oh, okay.
她说，哦，哦，好吧。

1192
00:56:37.720 --> 00:56:39.340
Well, Michael is distracted.
迈克尔此时心不在焉。

1193
00:56:39.640 --> 00:56:39.880
Yeah.
是啊。

1194
00:56:40.080 --> 00:56:43.560
He has just had such a huge life curveball thrown at him.
他刚刚遭遇了人生中巨大的变故。

1195
00:56:43.740 --> 00:56:45.540
He's just not there in the moment with her.
他现在根本没心思陪她。

1196
00:56:46.020 --> 00:56:47.580
Well, Kevin's there in the moment.
不过凯文倒是很上心。

1197
00:56:47.840 --> 00:56:48.560
He overhears.
他听到了。

1198
00:56:48.760 --> 00:56:49.780
He says, let's go.
他说，我们走吧。

1199
00:56:49.960 --> 00:56:51.040
She's like, great.
她说，太好了。

1200
00:56:51.440 --> 00:56:52.200
That's terrific.
那真是太棒了。

1201
00:56:52.480 --> 00:56:55.060
So now she's going to go off and have dessert with Kevin.
所以现在她要和凯文去吃甜点了。

1202
00:56:55.480 --> 00:56:57.240
Angela, I looked up the glider diner.
安吉拉，我查了滑翔机餐馆。

1203
00:56:57.320 --> 00:56:58.160
It's a real place.
那是个真实存在的地方。

1204
00:56:58.460 --> 00:56:58.960
Oh, yeah?
哦，是吗？

1205
00:56:59.380 --> 00:56:59.900
Oh, yeah.
哦，是的。

1206
00:57:00.060 --> 00:57:01.500
It's in downtown Scranton.
它就在斯克兰顿市中心。

1207
00:57:01.620 --> 00:57:03.880
It's right across from the Scranton Memorial Stadium.
就在斯克兰顿纪念体育场对面。

1208
00:57:03.880 --> 00:57:09.380
It was opened in 1945 by Chappie Lestrange and the late Gene Cosgrove, Sr.
它是由查皮·莱斯特兰奇和已故的吉恩·科斯格罗夫老先生于1945年开办的。

1209
00:57:10.200 --> 00:57:11.240
Chappie Lestrange?
查皮·莱斯特兰奇？

1210
00:57:12.140 --> 00:57:13.180
Chappie Lestrange.
查皮·莱斯特兰奇。

1211
00:57:13.400 --> 00:57:15.640
That is a name and then some.
这名字可真够劲儿的。

1212
00:57:15.840 --> 00:57:16.800
I love it.
我喜欢。

1213
00:57:16.960 --> 00:57:20.000
What about his partner, Gene Cosgrove, Sr.?
那他的合伙人吉恩·科斯格罗夫老先生呢？

1214
00:57:20.000 --> 00:57:21.420
I mean, come on, these two.
我是说，拜托，这两个人。

1215
00:57:21.640 --> 00:57:22.880
These are great names.
这些名字太棒了。

1216
00:57:23.100 --> 00:57:23.940
Chappie and Gene.
查皮和吉恩。

1217
00:57:24.380 --> 00:57:26.060
They were both in the service together.
他们俩曾一起服过役。

1218
00:57:26.120 --> 00:57:29.660
And when they got out, they decided they wanted to go in the restaurant business.
退伍后，他们决定投身餐饮业。

1219
00:57:29.660 --> 00:57:31.440
It was tough times at firSt.
起初日子很艰难。

1220
00:57:31.680 --> 00:57:35.220
Chappie had to sell tires on the side to keep things going.
查皮不得不私下卖轮胎来维持经营。

1221
00:57:35.420 --> 00:57:39.780
But it succeeded and the restaurant is still run by Chappie and his son, Charlie.
但最终成功了，这家餐馆现在仍由查皮和他的儿子查理经营。

1222
00:57:40.080 --> 00:57:40.820
Chappie and Charlie.
查皮和查理。

1223
00:57:41.040 --> 00:57:47.680
This was any inspiration for what's coming ahead in Work Bus where Laverne's pies and tires.
这是否启发了后来《工作巴士》里拉文的“派与轮胎”店？

1224
00:57:48.180 --> 00:57:49.160
I wonder.
我很好奇。

1225
00:57:50.000 --> 00:57:53.240
This is a diner and he had to sell tires on the side.
这是一家餐馆，而他不得不私下卖轮胎。

1226
00:57:53.480 --> 00:57:54.800
It's very possible.
很有可能。

1227
00:57:55.200 --> 00:57:59.240
The glider diner is open seven days a week and they're open until 10 p.m.
滑翔机餐馆每周营业七天，营业到晚上10点。

1228
00:57:59.240 --> 00:58:00.300
Monday through Saturday.
周一到周六。

1229
00:58:00.740 --> 00:58:01.700
So don't worry.
所以别担心。

1230
00:58:01.960 --> 00:58:04.480
Holly and Kevin have plenty of time to get dessert.
霍莉和凯文有充足的时间去吃甜点。

1231
00:58:04.640 --> 00:58:05.660
And here are their choices.
这是他们的选择。

1232
00:58:06.000 --> 00:58:07.200
I looked up the desserts.
我查了甜点菜单。

1233
00:58:07.800 --> 00:58:15.780
They can have rice pudding, baked pie, cake slice, baked pie with ice cream, tapioca pudding,
他们可以选米布丁、烤派、切片蛋糕、配冰淇淋的烤派、木薯布丁，

1234
00:58:16.400 --> 00:58:20.800
ice cream sundae, ice cream, or special dessert.
冰淇淋圣代、冰淇淋，或者特色甜点。

1235
00:58:23.380 --> 00:58:25.940
Lady, can we add this to the tour list?
女士，我们能把这个加进旅游清单吗？

1236
00:58:26.080 --> 00:58:29.020
And can I just propose that we get special dessert?
我能提议我们点特色甜点吗？

1237
